      "id": "claim_1499082288084005b7ced44849f00531",
      "statement": "The repository is Rafael Coelho Ventura's personal research repository for the [PROGRAMA-FOMENTO] fellowship project (Titled 'Mecanismo de atualização de memória para agentes de IA generativa com aprendizado por reforço aplicado a fluxos jurídicos'), and functions as the study/lab notebook for that work — bibliographic review, per-source notes, cross-cutting discussion, and a daily research diary kept together and versioned rather than scattered across documents.",
